      <b><span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">دَمٍ</span></b>  <i>Bleeding; having blood issuing from it:</i>
(S, * Msb:) [and] <i>bloody;</i> i. e. <i>smeared,</i> or <i>defiled,
